{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07884","headline":"送韩使君除洪州都曹 · 孟浩然","name":"送韩使君除洪州都曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"述职抚荆衡，分符袭宠荣。\n往来看拥传，前後赖专城。\n勿翦棠犹在，波澄水更清。\n重推江汉理，旋改豫章行。\n召父多遗爱，羊公有令名。\n衣冠列祖道，耆旧拥前旌。\n岘首晨风送，江陵夜火迎。\n无才慙孺子，千里媿同声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}